        "id": "12925760"
       }
      ],
      "value": "In resting B-cells it is localized mainly in the cytoplasm and upon cell activation it is recruited to the plasma membrane and then translocates to the nucleus (PubMed:10681448). In activated, class-switching B-cells it is associated with membrane IgG but not IgM (PubMed:10681448). Localized to loose actin filament arrays located behind actively extending lamellipodia (PubMed:12925760)"
     }
    ]
   },
